<view class="page safe-bottom"><view wx:if="{{demo}}" class="demo-banner">演示模式 · 本机体验，不会写入真实账本</view><view class="eyebrow">记下旅途中的小事</view><view class="heading">{{editing?'编辑这笔支出':'这笔钱，花在哪儿？'}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}<view wx:if="{{conflict}}" class="link" bindtap="refreshVersion">刷新账本版本，保留草稿后重试</view></view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="loading">正在加载同行成员…</view><block wx:else><text class="form-label">支出金额 · {{currency}}</text><view class="row"><text class="currency-symbol">{{symbol}}</text><input class="input amount-input" type="digit" value="{{amount}}" placeholder="0" data-field="amount" bindinput="field"/></view><text class="form-label">支出用途</text><input class="input" value="{{title}}" maxlength="100" placeholder="例如：日落前的一顿海鲜大餐" data-field="title" bindinput="field"/><view class="grid2"><view><text class="form-label">消费日期</text><picker mode="date" value="{{date}}" data-field="date" bindchange="field"><view class="picker">{{date}}</view></picker></view><view><text class="form-label">分类</text><picker range="{{categories}}" value="{{categoryIndex}}" data-field="categoryIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{categories[categoryIndex]}} ▾</view></picker></view></view><text class="form-label">谁垫付了？</text><picker range="{{names}}" value="{{payerIndex}}" data-field="payerIndex" bindchange="pick"><view class="picker">{{names[payerIndex]}} ▾</view></picker><text class="form-label">谁参与均分？</text><view class="help">只勾选实际参与消费的同行成员。</view><checkbox-group class="participants" bindchange="participants"><label wx:for="{{members}}" wx:key="id" class="participant"><checkbox value="{{item.id}}" checked="{{item.checked}}" color="#188675"/><text>{{item.name}}</text></label></checkbox-group><view wx:if="{{preview.length}}" class="card preview"><view class="tiny">按最小货币单位精确均分</view><view wx:for="{{preview}}" wx:key="id" class="row between"><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.amount}}</text></view></view><view class="help">尾差按稳定的成员顺序分配，分摊金额之和始终等于总额。</view><button class="button primary" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving || !members.length}}" bindtap="save">保存这笔支出</button></block></view>
